{%- comment -%}
  Ported from src/frontend/src/components/home/HomePage.astro (the homepage body; the hero is home-hero.liquid,
  rendered by the splash layout's hero). Root class (components.css scope): cid-home-home-page; it also imports
  src/frontend/src/styles/link-underline.css (site-wide in site-entry.css).
  Script: scripts/client/home/home-page.ts (reveals [data-home-reveal], the model story [data-model-story] with the
  terminal, stage tabs, code variants and dashboard rows, [data-language-list] shuffling).
  The fixed lists of the component (languages, resource icons and their animation delays, principles, observability
  links) are unrolled here; the two AppHost samples are Douze's fence markup, highlighted by the code worker as <Code>
  was (the code step's match must include index.html and the locale indexes).
{%- endcomment -%}
{%- include "partials/home/locale-prefix.liquid" %}
